OL,3,GNEWSAMatilda celebrates 15 years as
OL,4,AWest End success story
OL,5,
OL,6,FA musical that began life as a
OL,7,FChristmas production in
OL,8,FStratford-upon-Avon has become one of
OL,9,Fthe biggest theatre successes of the
OL,10,Fcentury as it celebrates 15 years in
OL,11,FLondon's West End.
OL,13,FMatilda The Musical, which is now the
OL,14,F10th longest-running musical in West
OL,15,FEnd history, has been seen by more than
OL,16,F12 million people around the world,
OL,17,Fstaged more than 10,000 performances
OL,18,Fand played in more than 100 cities.
OL,20,FComposer and lyricist Tim Minchin said
OL,21,Fhe was still amazed by the show's
OL,22,Fsuccess.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
